prerequisiteNote: "Increases facility in the analysis and usage of diatonic and chromatic harmonies. Continues harmonic analysis of Bach style. Includes exercises in sight-singing, ear-training, and keyboard harmony. Part II of II. Pre-requisite: MUS 211 or equivalent."
